The vendored portion is the GUI chrome in `anima/gui/`, derived from Aozora's
`gui/gui.py` and `gui/gui_theme.py` at commit b9efef2:

  anima/gui/theme.py     -- verbatim (was gui/gui_theme.py)
  anima/gui/widgets.py   -- derived: the widget factories, themed splitter,
                            CompressedLogBuffer / VirtualConsoleWidget,
                            CustomFolderDialog and GraphPanel, with Aozora's
                            SDXL- and timestep-allocation-specific code removed
  anima/gui/process.py   -- ProcessRunner derived from Aozora's, retargeted

A full copy of the Apache License 2.0 as distributed with Aozora is kept at
`anima/gui/LICENSE.Aozora`.

The remaining GUI modules -- `app.py`, `schema.py`, `bridge.py`, `fields.py`,
`metrics.py` -- are original to this project.
